## 19.2 根据结果选择叙事

### 情况 A：Endpoint 和 process 都有稳定差异

主张：

```text
social-interaction style changes both agent execution processes
and operational outcomes under controlled user behavior
```

### 情况 B：Endpoint 稳定，但 process 有稳定差异

将主要 insight 写为：

```text
Outcome stability can mask process instability:
agents may reach the same final state through socially contingent
evidence acquisition, branch decisions, or tool trajectories.
```

这不是临时转向，因为 process stability 已在预分析计划中冻结。

### 情况 C：Endpoint 和 process 都接近 null，且 CI 在等效 margin 内

可写：

```text
tested agents exhibit interactional robustness within
the prespecified margin on the evaluated domains
```

### 情况 D：差异不显著，但 CI 很宽

